  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Weekly newsletter (Lesson 5.6)\nThursday 10:00: read the price list, what's in season, one approved customer story and the approved offers. The AI drafts { subject_options[3], preview_text, sections[] }. Code blocks any price or discount that isn't in the sheets. Tolu picks a subject and approves on Telegram. Then Brevo creates the campaign (links tagged utm_source=email) and sends it at 17:00, unless email_paused is on.\n\nTEST MODE: Config sends to YOUR_BREVO_TEST_LIST_ID until you switch test_mode off.\n\nSheets (YOUR_SHEET_ID): Price list (product, price), In season (item, note), Customer stories (story, approved), Approved offers (offer), Settings (setting, value: email_paused).\nCredentials: Google Sheets; OpenAI; Telegram; Header Auth \"Brevo API key\" (Name api-key, Value your Brevo API key).\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_MODEL, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_BREVO_LIST_ID, YOUR_BREVO_TEST_LIST_ID, YOUR_ORDER_LINK.\nMailchimp instead: Mailchimp node, replicate last week's campaign, update content, Send.",
    "height": 460,
    "width": 580
   },
